<title>SWITZERLAND: Geneva January inflation rises to 0.9 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Geneva January inflation rises to 0.9 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>GENEVA 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consumer prices in Geneva, Switzerland's third largest city, rose 0.4 percent in January from the previous month for a year-on-year inflation rate of 0.9 percent, the city's Statistics Office said.</p>
<p>				    Jan 1997	Dec 1996	Jan 1996</p>
<p> Monthly CPI index change   0.4 pct	 0.1 pct	 0.3 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr inflation		0.9 pct	 0.7 pct	 1.2 pct</p>
<p> Index (May 1993 = 100)     104.4	   104.0	   103.5</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
